  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **By My Car (Feedback)**: rare: 13 archived performances [5]\n- **By My Car (Good version)**: rare: 13 archived performances [5]\n- **Black Sabbath (1st half)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [5]\n- **Black Sabbath (2nd half)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [5]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Mahgeetah, Steam Engine [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2002-11-08.m300.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 115 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: The Black Sabbath track appears split into two separate files in the recording; The recording captures both instruments and vocals with wonderful clarity and quality [3][4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Jim played a solo encore featuring Steam Engine and Bermuda Highway [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2002-11-08.m300.flac16**: taped by Jan de Bever & Michiel Oudendijk; transferred by Michiel Oudendijk; source: Microtech Gefell M300 > Apogee AD1000 > TCD-D8 [1]. Also: Benjamin Van Vliet is credited with contributing the detailed setlist information; PhoneWentDead is credited with labelling the individual tracks for the upload [1][2]",
